meta {
  name: Global Search
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/search/global
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "query": "Какие основные категории заболеваний встречаются во всех документах?",
    "top_k": 10
  }
}

docs {
  # POST /api/v1/search/global

  **GraphRAG global search** — map-reduce over the community summaries
  built offline. Small-tier MAP per community → large-tier REDUCE
  synthesis. Answers corpus-level / thematic questions no single chunk
  covers.

  ## Prerequisite
  Requires community summaries to exist — run **Admin → Rebuild
  Communities** (`POST /api/v1/admin/communities/rebuild`) first, or the
  overview comes back empty.

  ## When to use
  Aggregating / thematic questions: «обобщи», «основные темы / категории
  во всех документах», «что в целом».

  ## Request body
  - **query** *(required)*. **top_k** — accepted but barely used (retrieval
    is over community summaries, not chunks).

  ## Response 200 — `SearchResponse` with `"mode": "global"`.

  ## Tuning (server-side env)
  `AGENT_GLOBAL_MAX_COMMUNITIES` (how many communities enter MAP);
  MAP concurrency is bounded by `LLM_POOL_N`. Freshness depends on
  the last rebuild.

  ## Errors
  - `401` — auth. `500` — workflow raised.
}
